---
---
<section id="assistant" style="padding:6rem 2rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:center;">
  <!-- Purple radial background glow -->
  <div style="position:absolute;top:-40px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:100%;max-width:750px;height:160px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 40% at 50% 0%, rgba(139,92,246,0.08), transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;"></div>
  
  <div style="max-width:850px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2.25rem;">
    <!-- Section Title -->
    <h2 class="section-headline">It's not just <span class="accent">deployment.</span></h2>
    
    <!-- Body Copy -->
    <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.75;color:#a1a1aa;max-width:640px;display:block;margin:0 auto;">
      Deployment is the first capability, not the product. Nixora is the control plane for AI-generated software and AI agents: deploy and diagnose today, agent-native access through MCP next, and over time monitoring, scaling, governance, and multi-agent systems, all managed in one place.
    </p>

    <!-- Side-by-Side Split Card -->
    <div class="split-card-container">
      
      <!-- Left Column: TODAY -->
      <div class="split-card-col split-card-left">
        <div class="split-card-label split-label-left">TODAY · MANUAL WORKFLOW</div>
        <p class="split-card-text split-text-left">
          A person configures infrastructure, deploys it, monitors it, scales it, maintains it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: NEXT -->
      <div class="split-card-col split-card-right">
        <div class="split-card-label split-label-right">NEXT · NIXORA'S DIRECTION</div>
        <p class="split-card-text split-text-right">
          Nixora deploys it, diagnoses it. Over time: operates, monitors, scales, governs it too.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Scope Breadth Chip / Pill Components -->
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.55rem;margin-top:0.5rem;max-width:800px;">
      {[
        "Deploy & Run",
        "Lifecycle & Updates",
        "Insights & Cost",
        "Governance & Security",
        "Fleet & Scale",
        "Platform & Integrations"
      ].map(label => (
        <span class="scope-chip">{label}</span>
      ))}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .split-card-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 820px;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    border: 1px solid #1f1f1f;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 25px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .split-card-col {
    padding: 1.75rem 1.6rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .split-card-left {
    border-left: 3px solid #3f3f46;
    border-right: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01);
  }

  .split-card-right {
    border-left: 3px solid #a78bfa;
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.03);
  }

  .split-card-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    font-family: 'Fira Code', 'Geist Mono', monospace;
  }

  .split-label-left {
    color: #71717a;
  }

  .split-label-right {
    color: #a78bfa;
  }

  .split-card-text {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Fira Code', 'Geist Mono', monospace;
  }

  .split-text-left {
    color: #a1a1aa;
  }

  .split-text-right {
    color: #e4e4e7;
  }

  .scope-chip {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'Fira Code', 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid #222;
    color: #a1a1aa;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .scope-chip:hover {
    border-color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.4);
    color: #c4b5fd;
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.05);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .split-card-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .split-card-left {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    }
  }
</style>
